   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "\u00b7 user adds a key / buys credits \u2192 wake now\n\u00b7 'Continue with credits (~$X)' button\n\u00b7 cancel \u2192 remove delayed job, gen++,\n  release quota + holds\n\u00b7 parked > 48 h \u2192 finalize as needs_review\n  (partial diff kept)\n\u00b7 worker crash \u2192 lock expires \u2192 sweeper\n  re-enqueues from the last snapshot",
   "originalText": "\u00b7 user adds a key / buys credits \u2192 wake now\n\u00b7 'Continue with credits (~$X)' button\n\u00b7 cancel \u2192 remove delayed job, gen++,\n  release quota + holds\n\u00b7 parked > 48 h \u2192 finalize as needs_review\n  (partial diff kept)\n\u00b7 worker crash \u2192 lock expires \u2192 sweeper\n  re-enqueues from the last snapshot",
   "fontSize": 14,
   "fontFamily": 2,
