   "locked": false,
   "text": "429 / 503 / timeout \u2192 cooldown key\u00d7model, next lane\n401 / 403 \u2192 key marked revoked, next lane\n402 / insufficient_quota \u2192 out_of_funds\n413 too large \u2192 fix token estimate, skip lane\n400 missing signature \u2192 re-render once\n404 model gone \u2192 mark model, reroute\nglobal breaker: \u22653 users failing on a model in 60 s",
   "originalText": "429 / 503 / timeout \u2192 cooldown key\u00d7model, next lane\n401 / 403 \u2192 key marked revoked, next lane\n402 / insufficient_quota \u2192 out_of_funds\n413 too large \u2192 fix token estimate, skip lane\n400 missing signature \u2192 re-render once\n404 model gone \u2192 mark model, reroute\nglobal breaker: \u22653 users failing on a model in 60 s",
