   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "FREE  $0\n\u00b7 3 task runs per rolling 24 h (counted at run start)\n\u00b7 1 active task (parked ones count)\n\u00b7 standard queue \u00b7 3 follow-ups per task\n\u00b7 trial: 2 hosted tasks (GitHub acct \u2265 30 days)\n\nPRO  $8 / month\n\u00b7 25 tasks/day fair use \u00b7 3 active tasks\n\u00b7 priority queue + reserved worker slots\n\u00b7 $3 hosted credits / month (no rollover)\n\u00b7 private repos on non-training lanes\n\nPACKS  $5 \u2192 $4.25 credits (12 months)",
   "originalText": "FREE  $0\n\u00b7 3 task runs per rolling 24 h (counted at run start)\n\u00b7 1 active task (parked ones count)\n\u00b7 standard queue \u00b7 3 follow-ups per task\n\u00b7 trial: 2 hosted tasks (GitHub acct \u2265 30 days)\n\nPRO  $8 / month\n\u00b7 25 tasks/day fair use \u00b7 3 active tasks\n\u00b7 priority queue + reserved worker slots\n\u00b7 $3 hosted credits / month (no rollover)\n\u00b7 private repos on non-training lanes\n\nPACKS  $5 \u2192 $4.25 credits (12 months)",
   "fontSize": 14,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
  },
