   "versionNonce": 728975385,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "FREE KEYS  (user's own)\n\u00b7 Gemini \u00b7 Groq \u00b7 OpenRouter :free\n\u00b7 NVIDIA \u00b7 Mistral (opt-in, experimental)\n\nPAID KEYS  (user's own money)\n\u00b7 OpenAI \u00b7 Anthropic \u00b7 OpenRouter \u00b7 DeepSeek\n\u00b7 per-task cap (default $0.50) + monthly cap\n\nHOSTED CREDITS  (our key, micro-$ ledger)\n\u00b7 order used: monthly grant \u2192 packs \u2192 trial\n\nkeys encrypted with a separate KEK \u00b7 never\nshared across users \u00b7 tier auto-detected",
   "originalText": "FREE KEYS  (user's own)\n\u00b7 Gemini \u00b7 Groq \u00b7 OpenRouter :free\n\u00b7 NVIDIA \u00b7 Mistral (opt-in, experimental)\n\nPAID KEYS  (user's own money)\n\u00b7 OpenAI \u00b7 Anthropic \u00b7 OpenRouter \u00b7 DeepSeek\n\u00b7 per-task cap (default $0.50) + monthly cap\n\nHOSTED CREDITS  (our key, micro-$ ledger)\n\u00b7 order used: monthly grant \u2192 packs \u2192 trial\n\nkeys encrypted with a separate KEK \u00b7 never\nshared across users \u00b7 tier auto-detected",
   "fontSize": 14,
