   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "MODE\n\u00b7 Economy \u2014 free keys only; park instead of paying\n\u00b7 Balanced (default) \u2014 free \u2192 credits \u2192 paid,\n  wait \u2264 60 s for free quota before overflowing\n\u00b7 Max \u2014 credits / paid first, free as fallback\n\nSPEND ORDER  reorderable (default free\u2192credits\u2192paid)\n\nPRIVACY\n\u00b7 private repo \u2192 training lanes OFF (Gemini free,\n  Mistral free, OpenRouter :free, NVIDIA)\n\u00b7 per-repo consent turns them on",
   "originalText": "MODE\n\u00b7 Economy \u2014 free keys only; park instead of paying\n\u00b7 Balanced (default) \u2014 free \u2192 credits \u2192 paid,\n  wait \u2264 60 s for free quota before overflowing\n\u00b7 Max \u2014 credits / paid first, free as fallback\n\nSPEND ORDER  reorderable (default free\u2192credits\u2192paid)\n\nPRIVACY\n\u00b7 private repo \u2192 training lanes OFF (Gemini free,\n  Mistral free, OpenRouter :free, NVIDIA)\n\u00b7 per-repo consent turns them on",
   "fontSize": 14,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
