   "text": "\u00b7 the gate bounced 2+ times\n\u00b7 the same tool/test failure repeats twice\n\u00b7 stuck / churn detector fires (repeated reads, loops)\n\u00b7 2+ format errors \u00b7 the reviewer's fix round\n\u2026then drops back to T2 (de-escalation) to save T1 quota.",
   "originalText": "\u00b7 the gate bounced 2+ times\n\u00b7 the same tool/test failure repeats twice\n\u00b7 stuck / churn detector fires (repeated reads, loops)\n\u00b7 2+ format errors \u00b7 the reviewer's fix round\n\u2026then drops back to T2 (de-escalation) to save T1 quota.",
