   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Levers that make free \u2248 paid (success rate within 10 pp; time \u2264 2\u00d7)",
   "originalText": "Levers that make free \u2248 paid (success rate within 10 pp; time \u2264 2\u00d7)",
   "fontSize": 18,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
  },
  {
   "id": "elybomoyxp4qad",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 54,
   "y": 2958.5,
   "width": 1148.3999999999999,
   "height": 150.0,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 1,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [
    "elvramefktqlcj"
   ],
   "frameId": "el9ns8bolb6r1x",
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 427804769,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1620975343,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "1. Role lanes + escalation \u2014 strong model only where reasoning matters, chosen by MEASURED qualification per role\n2. Fewer requests (free quotas count requests): preloaded planned files \u00b7 parallel reads \u00b7 multi-file patches \u00b7 \u2264 30 calls/hard task\n3. Deterministic scaffolding that doesn't care which model runs: repo map \u00b7 grounding \u00b7 gate \u00b7 tsNotes \u00b7 dep cache \u00b7 repair pass\n4. Per-model adapters: edit format (str_replace vs apply_patch) picked by measured success; signatures handled\n5. Context policy per lane: cache-friendly masking on paid lanes, tighter compaction on no-cache free lanes\n6. Short timeouts + instant failover (free endpoints 503 / hang)\n7. Online learning: gate-pass & reviewer-pass rates per model \u00d7 role update routing weights\n8. Admission forecast: don't start a free task that can't finish on today's quota (no 12-hour half-done parks)",
   "originalText": "1. Role lanes + escalation \u2014 strong model only where reasoning matters, chosen by MEASURED qualification per role\n2. Fewer requests (free quotas count requests): preloaded planned files \u00b7 parallel reads \u00b7 multi-file patches \u00b7 \u2264 30 calls/hard task\n3. Deterministic scaffolding that doesn't care which model runs: repo map \u00b7 grounding \u00b7 gate \u00b7 tsNotes \u00b7 dep cache \u00b7 repair pass\n4. Per-model adapters: edit format (str_replace vs apply_patch) picked by measured success; signatures handled\n5. Context policy per lane: cache-friendly masking on paid lanes, tighter compaction on no-cache free lanes\n6. Short timeouts + instant failover (free endpoints 503 / hang)\n7. Online learning: gate-pass & reviewer-pass rates per model \u00d7 role update routing weights\n8. Admission forecast: don't start a free task that can't finish on today's quota (no 12-hour half-done parks)",
   "fontSize": 15,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
  },
