   "text": "sandbox compute   $0.002 \u2013 $0.008\nmodel (hosted), avg hard task at list prices:\n  gpt-5-mini            $0.087  (measured)\n  DeepSeek V4.1 Flash  $0.010  (estimate \u2192 measure)\n  GLM-5.3 Flash        $0.018  (estimate)\n  Claude Sonnet 5      $0.60   (estimate, BYOK)\nfree-key tasks: $0 model cost to us",
