   "text": "our spend ledger (1,893 calls / 64 tasks) \u00b7 probes with the owner's Gemini + Groq keys (2026-09-27)\nGoogle Gemini pricing page \u00b7 Groq rate-limit headers \u00b7 OpenRouter public model catalogue (live prices, 458 models)\nAWS EC2 prices via Vantage (t4g.large $0.0672/h, t4g.xlarge $0.1344/h, spot $0.071) \u00b7 Dodo Payments pricing\nNeon free plan (0.5 GB, 100 CU-h) \u00b7 per-task model cost = our measured token profile \u00d7 catalogue price",
   "originalText": "our spend ledger (1,893 calls / 64 tasks) \u00b7 probes with the owner's Gemini + Groq keys (2026-09-27)\nGoogle Gemini pricing page \u00b7 Groq rate-limit headers \u00b7 OpenRouter public model catalogue (live prices, 458 models)\nAWS EC2 prices via Vantage (t4g.large $0.0672/h, t4g.xlarge $0.1344/h, spot $0.071) \u00b7 Dodo Payments pricing\nNeon free plan (0.5 GB, 100 CU-h) \u00b7 per-task model cost = our measured token profile \u00d7 catalogue price",
