   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "S  \u2264 2 files, \u2264 6 reqs \u2192 cheapest qualified lane\n    (nano / Flash-Lite) \u00b7 cap 25 calls \u00b7 1 review\nM  3\u20134 files or 7\u201310 reqs \u2192 T2 + escalation\n    \u00b7 cap 45 \u00b7 review + fix round\nL  \u2265 5 files / > 10 reqs / multi-package \u2192 T1\n    from the start \u00b7 cap 80 \u00b7 full review + repair\nonline: touched > planned+2, calls > 1.5\u00d7 median,\n2 gate bounces \u2192 move up a tier",
   "originalText": "S  \u2264 2 files, \u2264 6 reqs \u2192 cheapest qualified lane\n    (nano / Flash-Lite) \u00b7 cap 25 calls \u00b7 1 review\nM  3\u20134 files or 7\u201310 reqs \u2192 T2 + escalation\n    \u00b7 cap 45 \u00b7 review + fix round\nL  \u2265 5 files / > 10 reqs / multi-package \u2192 T1\n    from the start \u00b7 cap 80 \u00b7 full review + repair\nonline: touched > planned+2, calls > 1.5\u00d7 median,\n2 gate bounces \u2192 move up a tier",
