   "text": "planned files vs cost r = 0.85 (31 gpt-5-mini tasks)\n1\u20132 files: 11 calls \u00b7 $0.010 \u00b7 9/9   3\u20134: 20 \u00b7 $0.037 \u00b7 8/8   5+: 28 \u00b7 $0.089 \u00b7 10/14\nweak planners under-plan (4.1-nano: H03 = 2 files; 5.4-nano: 4 files)\ncheap models on 5 items: 5-mini 5/5 $0.157 \u00b7 5.4-nano 4/5 $0.083\n5-nano 3/5 $0.051 \u00b7 4.1-nano 2/5 \u00b7 4o-mini 0/3 $0.185\n`risks` filled in 47/49 plans \u2192 no signal",
   "originalText": "planned files vs cost r = 0.85 (31 gpt-5-mini tasks)\n1\u20132 files: 11 calls \u00b7 $0.010 \u00b7 9/9   3\u20134: 20 \u00b7 $0.037 \u00b7 8/8   5+: 28 \u00b7 $0.089 \u00b7 10/14\nweak planners under-plan (4.1-nano: H03 = 2 files; 5.4-nano: 4 files)\ncheap models on 5 items: 5-mini 5/5 $0.157 \u00b7 5.4-nano 4/5 $0.083\n5-nano 3/5 $0.051 \u00b7 4.1-nano 2/5 \u00b7 4o-mini 0/3 $0.185\n`risks` filled in 47/49 plans \u2192 no signal",
