   "text": "Ask-or-Assume: full 70.8% \u00b7 vague 54.8% \u00b7 self-decide 61.2%\n  \u00b7 separate intent agent 69.4% (\u2248 full)\nAmbig-SWE: models 'almost never interact' unprompted;\n  asking recovers 89% (Sonnet 4) \u2026 59% (DeepSeek)\nSWE-bench-M: text-heavy images 23.1 \u2192 23.1% without them,\n  non-text 13.0 \u2192 8.7% \u2192 planner/reviewer keep pixels",
